$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=vebkz2a  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for vebkz (leftover positions): given an injection f from the residual characters r into the positions ( K + 1 ) ... M, the map sending position i to the value of the character `' f ( i ) at F ( i ) (and 1 off the range of f) is nonzero everywhere and matches every residual character at its own position.

